msgid "WP Rocket → Settings → CDN → Clear all cache files. (Or purge from your CDN dashboard directly.) Until you purge, the CDN keeps serving the old response without the new header."
msgstr "WP Rocket → Definições → CDN → Limpar todos os ficheiros de cache. (Ou limpa diretamente no painel da tua CDN.) Enquanto não limpares, a CDN continua a servir a resposta antiga sem o novo cabeçalho."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
