msgstr "Permitir apenas para um tipo de conteúdo específico:"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:141
msgid "Read-Along Highlight"
msgstr "Destaque durante a leitura"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:144
msgid "Highlight the word and/or sentence being spoken while the post is read aloud."
msgstr "Destaca a palavra e/ou a frase que está a ser lida enquanto o artigo é lido em voz alta."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:162
msgid "speechSynthesis limitation:"
msgstr "Limitação do speechSynthesis:"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:163
msgid "Word-level highlighting relies on the browser's speechSynthesis “boundary” events, which only fire for local (offline) device voices. Remote voices (e.g. the “Google …” voices) and some browsers (notably Firefox) fire no word boundaries, so word highlighting can't track them. When that happens the player automatically falls back to sentence highlighting. Sentence highlighting works with every voice and browser — it's the recommended default."
msgstr "O destaque ao nível da palavra depende dos eventos “boundary” do speechSynthesis do navegador, que só ocorrem com vozes locais (offline) do dispositivo. As vozes remotas (por exemplo as vozes “Google …”) e alguns navegadores (sobretudo o Firefox) não geram limites de palavra, por isso o destaque por palavra não as consegue acompanhar. Quando isso acontece, o leitor passa automaticamente ao destaque por frase. O destaque por frase funciona com qualquer voz e navegador — é a predefinição recomendada."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:180
msgid "Precise word timing:"
msgstr "Sincronização precisa das palavras:"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:181
msgid "This player generates audio with real per-word timing, so word-by-word highlighting is accurate and works in every browser — no local-voice requirement and no fallback."
msgstr "Este leitor gera o áudio com a sincronização real de cada palavra, por isso o destaque palavra a palavra é rigoroso e funciona em todos os navegadores — sem necessidade de vozes locais e sem alternativas."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:200
msgid "Already-generated audio:"
msgstr "Áudio já gerado:"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:201
msgid "Word timing is captured while the audio is being generated, so posts whose MP3 was created before highlighting was enabled have no timing data — they will use sentence highlighting until their audio is regenerated. To upgrade them, regenerate the audio with the Bulk MP3 tool (or regenerate an individual post). Note: regeneration sends the post content to your TTS provider (Google Cloud / ElevenLabs) again, so it consumes provider characters/credits just like the first generation — word timing can only be produced by the provider during synthesis, which is why it isn't added to existing files automatically."
msgstr "A sincronização das palavras é registada enquanto o áudio está a ser gerado, por isso os artigos cujo MP3 foi criado antes de o destaque estar ativo não têm dados de sincronização — vão usar o destaque por frase até o áudio ser gerado de novo. Para os atualizares, gera novamente o áudio com a ferramenta de MP3 em massa (ou gera novamente um artigo individual). Nota: a nova geração envia outra vez o conteúdo do artigo para o teu fornecedor de TTS (Google Cloud / ElevenLabs), por isso consome caracteres/créditos do fornecedor tal como a primeira geração — a sincronização das palavras só pode ser produzida pelo fornecedor durante a síntese, e é por isso que não é acrescentada automaticamente aos ficheiros existentes."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:100
msgid "Successfully Saved..."
msgstr "Guardado com sucesso..."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:212
msgid "Enable highlighting"
msgstr "Ativar o destaque"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:214
msgid "Turn read-along highlighting on or off for the browser players."
msgstr "Ativa ou desativa o destaque durante a leitura nos leitores do navegador."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:226
msgid "Highlight mode"
msgstr "Modo de destaque"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-highlight.5d733dfd1bbfeb49.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/highlight/Highlight.js:228
msgid "“Sentence only” works with any voice. “Word” and “Word + Sentence” need a local voice that fires boundary events, and fall back to sentence highlighting otherwise."
